<div class="changelog-card">
  <div class="changelog-card-top">
    <span class="changelog-version">v1.7</span>
    <span class="changelog-date">December 2025</span>
  </div>

  <div class="changelog-group">
    <div class="changelog-label">Major Changes</div>
    <ul>
      <li>New <code>/config</code> settings: <code>Allow Threads</code> & <code>DM Members</code></li>
      <li>Readded documentation, was previously removed</li>
      <li>REST API (V1) has been implemented</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="changelog-group">
    <div class="changelog-label">OnlyOneMessage Website</div>
    <ul>
      <li>The <code>Get Started</code> and <code>How it Works</code> section has been replaced with statistics</li>
      <li>A documentation page has been added</li>
      <li>Some words have been emphasized</li>
      <li>Site-wide animations</li>
      <li>The carousel in the <code>About</code> section should be fixed</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="changelog-group">
    <div class="changelog-label">Minor Changes</div>
    <ul>
      <li>Metrics method has been changed to Prometheus from MongoDB</li>
      <li>OnlyOneMessage's method of running has been changed</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="changelog-group">
    <div class="changelog-label">Bug Fixes</div>
    <ul>
      <li>Loops should no longer stack upon cogs reloading</li>
